---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---
<Figure id="d-proto-entry-life">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 450" role="img" aria-label="A log entry's life: a sealed call reaches any node, which judges the caller and forwards to the app's leader; the leader runs the component over the state at the app's last entry and gets an outcome; it wraps it in a componentCall entry naming its base index; the entry is appended to the sealed Raft log and committed by a majority; every replica applies it, or applies it as a no-op conflict when the base index moved; applying writes the state rows, the event ring, the idempotency record and the head in one batch with the applied index; snapshots and the answer with its receipt follow." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <defs><marker id="pel-arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#8b949e"/></marker></defs>
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="450" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>
  <text x="380" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">a log entry, from the client to applied state</text>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <rect x="16" y="40" width="170" height="78" rx="8" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="101" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">1 client</text>
    <text x="101" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">sealed POST</text>
    <text x="101" y="89" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">/apps/&#123;app&#125;/intents</text>
    <text x="101" y="102" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">&#123; method, args, key &#125;</text>
    <line x1="186" y1="79" x2="202" y2="79" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:1">
    <rect x="204" y="40" width="170" height="78" rx="8" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="289" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">2 entry node</text>
    <text x="289" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">principal + gate at</text>
    <text x="289" y="89" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">a read index n;</text>
    <text x="289" y="102" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">internal/call to leader</text>
    <line x1="374" y1="79" x2="390" y2="79" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:2">
    <rect x="392" y="40" width="170" height="78" rx="8" fill="#161b22" stroke="#58a6ff" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="477" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">3 app leader</text>
    <text x="477" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">propose lock; replay a</text>
    <text x="477" y="89" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">known key, else run the</text>
    <text x="477" y="102" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">component at last_index</text>
    <line x1="562" y1="79" x2="578" y2="79" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:3">
    <rect x="580" y="40" width="164" height="78" rx="8" fill="#16222e" stroke="#39d0d8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="662" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#39d0d8" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">4 Outcome</text>
    <text x="662" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">status, result, diff,</text>
    <text x="662" y="89" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">events, xcalls, files,</text>
    <text x="662" y="102" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">http, compute starts</text>
    <line x1="662" y1="118" x2="662" y2="140" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:4">
    <rect x="470" y="142" width="274" height="84" rx="8" fill="#13160f" stroke="#a5ff11" stroke-width="1.6"/>
    <text x="607" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5ff11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">5 entry &#123; "op": "componentCall", … &#125;</text>
    <text x="607" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">method, args, caller, key, consent,</text>
    <text x="607" y="191" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">tsMs, baseIndex, idTerm/idSeq, outcome</text>
    <text x="607" y="208" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">JSON · at most 1 MiB · ENTRY_FORMAT 1</text>
    <line x1="470" y1="184" x2="454" y2="184" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:5">
    <rect x="212" y="142" width="240" height="84" rx="8" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a371f7" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="332" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a371f7" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">6 Raft log (calimero-log)</text>
    <text x="332" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">appended to the replicas;</text>
    <text x="332" y="191" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">committed once a majority has it</text>
    <text x="332" y="208" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">`log` column, sealed under K_c</text>
    <line x1="212" y1="184" x2="196" y2="184" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:6">
    <rect x="16" y="142" width="178" height="84" rx="8" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="105" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">7 apply, every replica</text>
    <text x="105" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">baseIndex = last_index?</text>
    <text x="105" y="191" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">yes: apply the diff</text>
    <text x="105" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">no: no-op, conflict;</text>
    <text x="105" y="217" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the leader runs again</text>
    <line x1="105" y1="226" x2="105" y2="248" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:7">
    <rect x="16" y="250" width="728" height="98" rx="8" fill="#161b22" stroke="#39d0d8" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="380" y="268" text-anchor="middle" fill="#39d0d8" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">8 one RocksDB batch, with the new applied index</text>
    <rect x="30" y="280" width="164" height="56" rx="6" fill="#16222e" stroke="#39d0d8"/>
    <text x="112" y="298" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">app keys</text>
    <text x="112" y="313" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">rows `c`+key, hidden</text>
    <text x="112" y="326" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the diff's writes</text>
    <rect x="208" y="280" width="164" height="56" rx="6" fill="#16222e" stroke="#39d0d8"/>
    <text x="290" y="298" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">event ring</text>
    <text x="290" y="313" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">rows `e`‖n, last 10 000</text>
    <text x="290" y="326" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">with their audiences</text>
    <rect x="386" y="280" width="164" height="56" rx="6" fill="#16222e" stroke="#39d0d8"/>
    <text x="468" y="298" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">idempotency</text>
    <text x="468" y="313" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">rows `j`, hidden; `q`</text>
    <text x="468" y="326" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the answer, for a retry</text>
    <rect x="564" y="280" width="166" height="56" rx="6" fill="#16222e" stroke="#39d0d8"/>
    <text x="647" y="298" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700">head `h`</text>
    <text x="647" y="313" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">last_index, lastWriteMs,</text>
    <text x="647" y="326" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">timers, active runs</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:8">
    <line x1="200" y1="348" x2="200" y2="370" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="16" y="372" width="360" height="62" rx="8" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a371f7" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="196" y="392" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a371f7" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">9 snapshot, every 1000 entries</text>
    <text x="196" y="410" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">CALIMERO-SNAPSHOT-1 file of sealed frames;</text>
    <text x="196" y="423" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the log is compacted behind it (100 kept)</text>
    <line x1="560" y1="348" x2="560" y2="370" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.3" marker-end="url(#pel-arrow)"/>
    <rect x="388" y="372" width="356" height="62" rx="8" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="566" y="392" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">10 the answer</text>
    <text x="566" y="410" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">&#123; index, result, events, receipt &#125;, the events</text>
    <text x="566" y="423" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the caller is in the audience of, sealed back</text>
  </g>
</svg>
</Figure>
